%rec: OpeningBranch

# Flag: solved_bobs_problems

cond: !HasFlag('solved_bobs_problems')
goto: BasicSupply

cond: HasFlag('solved_bobs_problems')
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: Exit
npc: Come back soon!
effect: EndConversation

name: BasicSupply
npc: Welcome to Big Bob's Supplies!
+ Unfortunately, I have a small problem with my deliveries.
+ So for now, I can only offer you a limited selection of items.
#
o_text: Show me what you have.
o_id: show_wares
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: BasicSupply
#
o_text: (Show him the synth duck.) Anna's. What's it worth to you in parts?
o_id: sell_duck_bob
o_cond: HasItem('synth_duck_item')
o_goto: SellDuck
#
o_text: I'll need exactly 1 round of ammo.
o_cond: !HasFlag('took_single_round')
o_goto: BuySingleRound
#
o_text: Tell me about your 'problem'.
o_id: bob_problem
o_goto: TellMeAboutProblem
#
o_text: What's the neighborhood like?
o_goto: TellMeAboutNeighborhood
#
o_text: I see, goodbye.
o_id: bye
o_goto: Exit

name: BuySMG
npc: Good choice! It's a reliable weapon. You'll need some ammo for it, too.
+ That burst fire mode can be a real life saver, but it eats through ammo like crazy.
#
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 500)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, '10mm_smg')
#
o_text: Thanks, I am good on ammo.
o_goto: BasicSupply
#
o_text: I'll take some ammo.
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 50)
o_goto: BuyAmmo
#
o_text: I'll need exactly 1 round of ammo.
o_cond: !HasFlag('took_single_round')
o_goto: BuySingleRound
#
o_text: I better get going.
o_goto: Exit

name: BuyAmmo
npc: Here you go. Enjoy your purchase!
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 50)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, '10mm_jhp', 24)
#
o_text: Nice doing business with you.
o_goto: BasicSupply
#
o_text: That's all I need for now.
o_goto: Exit

name: BuySingleRound
npc: Haha, that's original! Here you go. This one's on the house.
+ I am pretty sure you'll be back for more soon.
+ Or... maybe not.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, '10mm_jhp', 1)
effect: SetFlag('took_single_round')
#
o_text: Alright, show me what else you have.
o_goto: BasicSupply
#
o_text: I'll be back.
o_goto: Exit
#
o_text: This bullet is all I need.
o_goto: Exit
#
o_text: I'll have some engraving to do, excuse me.
o_goto: Exit

name: TellMeAboutProblem
npc: I have a delivery coming in from the north, but the road is blocked.
+ I can't get in touch with the driver, either.
+ I am starting to get worried.
#
o_text: I can help you with that.
o_id: bob_help
o_goto: OfferToHelp
#
o_text: I see, goodbye.
o_id: bye
o_goto: Exit

name: OfferToHelp
npc: The truck's stuck at the EBI checkpoint on the north road. They want a transit permit nobody's ever seen.
+ Get it through and you get the full shelves, and a friend's price.
#
o_text: (Call the checkpoint.) This is the district office. That truck carries our ammunition. Wave it through.
o_id: bob_bluff
o_cond: !HasFlag('bob_truck_tried')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Medium')
o_succ: TruckThrough
o_fail: TruckStuck
#
o_text: Give me your terminal. I'll write them the permit they've never seen.
o_id: bob_permit
o_cond: !HasFlag('bob_truck_tried')
o_test: RollSkill('technology', 'Medium')
o_succ: TruckThrough
o_fail: TruckStuck
#
o_text: (Pay 100.) Checkpoints run on cash. I'll take it to them.
o_id: bob_bribe
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 100)
o_goto: TruckBribed
#
o_text: I'll be back.
o_goto: Exit

name: TruckBribed
npc: (He nods slowly.) Cash. Of course. (An hour later his phone rings.) It's through!
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 100)
effect: SetFlag('solved_bobs_problems')
#
o_text: Told you.
o_id: bob_bribed_done
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: TruckThrough
npc: (His phone rings before you hang up.) It's moving! The truck is moving!
effect: SetFlag('solved_bobs_problems')
#
o_text: Told you.
o_id: bob_through_done
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: TruckStuck
npc: (The line goes dead.) They're holding it tighter now. Cash, then. It's always cash.
effect: SetFlag('bob_truck_tried')
#
o_text: I'll be back.
o_goto: Exit

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Welcome back to Big Bob's Supplies! The shelves are full again, thanks to you.
#
o_text: Show me what you have.
o_id: show_wares
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction
#
o_text: (Show him the synth duck.) Anna's. What's it worth to you in parts?
o_id: sell_duck_bob
o_cond: HasItem('synth_duck_item')
o_goto: SellDuck
#
o_text: What's the neighborhood like?
o_goto: TellMeAboutNeighborhood
#
o_text: I see, goodbye.
o_id: bye
o_goto: Exit

name: TellMeAboutNeighborhood
npc: Quiet, mostly. People here keep their heads down and their doors locked.
+ Quinn down the street is the exception. I'd give him room.
+ Other than that, the worst you'll meet around here is me, before my first coffee.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: SellDuck
npc: (He turns it over and pops a panel with his thumbnail.) Military-grade servos in a toy. Three hundred.
+ Anna pays you what, a hundred and a smile? I'll have it in a drone by Friday. What she doesn't know won't quack.
#
o_text: Sold.
o_id: duck_sold
o_goto: DuckSold
#
o_text: Never mind.
o_id: duck_keep
o_goto: Exit

name: DuckSold
npc: (He drops it in a crate under the counter. It says "quack" once, muffled.)
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'synth_duck_item')
effect: PlayerAddGold(300)
effect: SetFlag('duck_sold_to_bob')
effect: EndConversation
